                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: human resources, personnel"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2733c241-aea3-4523-b96c-41ed5db393cc",
                                                "sense_id": "9a529073-a03c-3546-83c0-6972526640f6",
                                                "text": "phased increases in manpower"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17a4f285-c02d-416a-ae8d-88cbc79a83d8",
                                                "sense_id": "9a529073-a03c-3546-83c0-6972526640f6",
                                                "text": "The closure is stated officially to be solely due to the manpower position."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7159b001-2343-47f3-b37c-fcb0b4d87e50",
                                                "sense_id": "9a529073-a03c-3546-83c0-6972526640f6",
                                                "text": "Since manpower represents so high a proportion of railway costs, attention by management to the study of work procedures with a view to better utilisation of—\"and indeed greater rewards for\"—the manpower employed was of special importance, said Mr. Blee."
                                            }
                                        ]
